{"name": "Let's Duck!", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tLet's Duck! is a top-down co-op roguelike about rubber ducks defending their pond. Swim, dash and QUACK! through swarms of soap gremlins, spitter frogs and snapping turtles, scoop up the breadcrumbs they drop, level up, and beat the boss at the end of each map. Play alone or with up to three friends online.<br/><br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5428530/extras/fb76242e6613e964057bad68204b6592.poster.avif?t=1794177976\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5428530/extras/fb76242e6613e964057bad68204b6592.webm?t=1794177976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5428530/extras/fb76242e6613e964057bad68204b6592.mp4?t=1794177976\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span><br/><br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5428530/extras_big/9576aa24667d138b5ab47f2f5a1e617b.webp?t=1794177976\" height=\"300\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5428530/extras/9576aa24667d138b5ab47f2f5a1e617b.avif?t=1794177976\" width=\"1560\"/></span><br/><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Your clothes are your skills.</strong> Mix and match in three slots: a hat, a jacket and an accessory. Each one fires its own attack: the pirate hat lobs cannonballs, the shower cap sprays a jet, the cozy scarf whirls feathers around you.<br/></li><li>Your three skills cast on their own. You steer, dash, and quack to shove the swarm back.<br/></li><li>Bosses drop clothes of their own.</li></ul><br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5428530/extras/1ff14226b9a3b454cddbe73c4c35e5d2.poster.avif?t=1794177976\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5428530/extras/1ff14226b9a3b454cddbe73c4c35e5d2.webm?t=1794177976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5428530/extras/1ff14226b9a3b454cddbe73c4c35e5d2.mp4?t=1794177976\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span><br/><br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5428530/extras_big/a29101f17ad7e6fb2510b27401d1185c.webp?t=1794177976\" height=\"300\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5428530/extras/a29101f17ad7e6fb2510b27401d1185c.avif?t=1794177976\" width=\"1560\"/></span><br/><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>1-4 ducks, online over Steam.</strong> Friends join you in your pond and launch the run together.<br/></li><li>Go down and you float on as a ghost duck. Your team revives you at your grave.<br/></li><li>Trophies to earn, each one also a Steam achievement.</li></ul><br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5428530/extras/0e2e04b0e3587c2a10a9d190db2015b0.poster.avif?t=1794177976\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5428530/extras/0e2e04b0e3587c2a10a9d190db2015b0.webm?t=1794177976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5428530/extras/0e2e04b0e3587c2a10a9d190db2015b0.mp4?t=1794177976\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span><br/><br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5428530/extras_big/6e5747e6d5c6a4d33e4af463c5f1982b.webp?t=1794177976\" height=\"300\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5428530/extras/6e5747e6d5c6a4d33e4af463c5f1982b.avif?t=1794177976\" width=\"1560\"/></span><br/><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Every team level deals you a hand of cards: common, rare, epic, legendary or golden.<br/></li><li>Three rerolls a run. Or bet the whole hand on the casino reels: three of a kind and you get three cards of that rarity.</li></ul><br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5428530/extras/85ffdaff6bdfe5ccabda532b9b8885c0.poster.avif?t=1794177976\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5428530/extras/85ffdaff6bdfe5ccabda532b9b8885c0.webm?t=1794177976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5428530/extras/85ffdaff6bdfe5ccabda532b9b8885c0.mp4?t=1794177976\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span><br/><br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5428530/extras_big/99e200f64b0a52d9ba8450e35f463aa5.webp?t=1794177976\" height=\"300\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5428530/extras/99e200f64b0a52d9ba8450e35f463aa5.avif?t=1794177976\" width=\"1560\"/></span><br/><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Maps on an adventure sea chart</strong>, each with its own enemies and its own boss: The Old Pike, Ol' Grumblejaw, Captain Squeakbeard, The Kraken, The Magma Turtle and The Phantom Swan.<br/></li><li>Every boss has an ULTRA FURIOUS! last phase.<br/></li><li>Four difficulties (Puddle, Pond, Lake, Ocean), run traits that trade an upside for a catch, and Heat when you want it harder.</li></ul><br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5428530/extras/d629d3b2ec0eb92775e7bbae62987e59.poster.avif?t=1794177976\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5428530/extras/d629d3b2ec0eb92775e7bbae62987e59.webm?t=1794177976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5428530/extras/d629d3b2ec0eb92775e7bbae62987e59.mp4?t=1794177976\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span><br/><br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5428530/extras_big/26f89bf4828a77fc34d5bcca78a895c8.webp?t=1794177976\" height=\"300\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5428530/extras/26f89bf4828a77fc34d5bcca78a895c8.avif?t=1794177976\" width=\"1560\"/></span><br/><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Your pond is your home and your menu: swim to the wardrobe, the trophy shelf or the Adventure Tunnel.<br/></li><li>Decorate it with pieces you unlock, and show it off to friends who drop by.<br/></li><li>Feather colors to find.</li></ul> </div>", "short_desc": "Rubber ducks defend their pond in a co-op roguelike for 1-4 players. Every hat, jacket and accessory is a skill: dress up, quack the swarm back, pick level-up cards or bet them on the casino reels, and take down bosses that go ULTRA FURIOUS! at the end.", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5428530/145e683e7524860d1f9138e05e6e78b26ef29e21/header.jpg?t=1794177976", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Action Roguelike", "Bullet Heaven", "Roguelite", "Online Co-Op", "Action", "Casual"], "developers": "Basemint Studios", "publishers": "Basemint Studios"